
% Party Rock Anthem

a: R |
drop: R |
In: $a*4
b: vi | V . . IV |
In_b: $b*4
hook: $b*4
hook_riser: $b*4
bridge: $b*4
PostCh: $b*4
outro: $b*4
c: vi |
DCh: $c*3 $b
bc: $b $c
Vr: $bc*4
link: $bc*2
riser: $c*6
S: $In $In_b $hook $hook_riser $DCh $Vr $hook $drop $DCh $link $bridge $riser $hook $PostCh $outro*2
